---
description: Tellus repository guidance
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` before editing. Tellus uses Bun, React, Three.js/WebGPU, and
Hyades as the authoritative backend.

- Run relevant checks before handing back work: `bun run typecheck`,
  `bun run test`, and for frontend/runtime changes `bun run build`.
- Keep MCP docs public; keep bearer token minting and endpoint use premium
  gated server-side.
- Do not expose secrets, bearer tokens, cookies, or Nostr private keys.
- UI/account work usually starts in `src/main.tsx`, `src/styles.css`, and
  `src/tellus-auth-ui.tsx`.
- Movement/performance work usually starts in `src/main.tsx`,
  `src/tellus-rapier-physics.ts`, `src/tellus-terrain.ts`, and
  `src/tellus-scene-builders.ts`.
